      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "2a0bd25a-bb68-5c08-aa4d-438245ef5421",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rocket Raccoon, Paul McCartney, John Lennon, Donovan, Trevor Devall\n- Works: \"Rocky Raccoon\", \"Guardians of the Galaxy\", \"Lego Star Wars\", \"X-Men Evolution\", \"Johnny Test\", \"F Is for Family\", \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", \"InuYasha\", \"Black Lagoon\", \"Death Note\"\n- Places: India\n- Topics: character inspiration, songwriting, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Paul McCartney primarily wrote the Beatles' 1968 song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\n- Paul McCartney was inspired to write \"Rocky Raccoon\" while playing acoustic guitar with John Lennon and Donovan in India during the Beatles' retreat there.\n- Rocket Raccoon's name and parts of his character were a nod to the song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\n- Trevor Devall is best known for voicing Rocket Raccoon in the animated TV series \"Guardians of the Galaxy\".\n- Trevor Devall also voiced Emperor Palpatine in \"Lego Star Wars\", Pyro in \"X-Men Evolution\", Dukey in seasons 5 and 6 of \"Johnny Test\", and various characters in the Netflix original series \"F Is for Family\".\n- Trevor Devall provided English-language anime voices including Mu La Flaga in \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", Mukotsu in \"InuYasha\", Mr. Chang in \"Black Lagoon\", and Aizawa in \"Death Note\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "84a10d11-faaa-59a5-a228-a718a6363aec",
        "text": "Page: Rocket Raccoon. Sentence: His name and aspects of his character are a nod to The Beatles' 1968 song \"Rocky Raccoon\".\nPage: Rocky Raccoon. Sentence: The song was primarily written by Paul McCartney, who was inspired while playing acoustic guitar with John Lennon and Donovan in India (where the Beatles had gone on a retreat).\nPage: Trevor Devall. Sentence: He is best known for voicing Rocket Raccoon in the animated TV series \"Guardians of the Galaxy\", Emperor Palpatine in \"Lego Star Wars\", Pyro in \"X-Men Evolution\", Dukey in seasons 5 and 6 of \"Johnny Test\", and various characters in the Netflix original series \"F Is for Family\", as well as providing voices in English-language versions of various anime series, most notably as Mu La Flaga from \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\", Mukotsu from \"InuYasha\", from \"\", Mr. Chang from \"Black Lagoon\", and Aizawa from \"Death Note\".",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
      },
